msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Modifica la struttura del menu come JSON. Ogni elemento può avere: name, "
"icon, command (eseguito tramite la shell) o action (un'azione di sessione: "
"lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), "
"submenu (array di elementi) o separator (true)."

